06,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1ODk0MDA2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15894006?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gordthompson","html_url":"https://github.com/gordthompson","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gordthompson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gordthompson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gordthompson/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gordthompson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gordthompson/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gordthompson/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gordthompson/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gordthompson/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gordthompson/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-10-08T13:36:40Z","updated_at":"2021-10-08T13:36:40Z","body":"The information is definitely in there:\r\n\r\n> SELECT * FROM INFORMATION_SCHEMA.REFERENTIAL_CONSTRAINTS\r\n\r\n```\r\nCONSTRAINT_CATALOG CONSTRAINT_SCHEMA CONSTRAINT_NAME             UNIQUE_CONSTRAINT_CATALOG UNIQUE_CONSTRAINT_SCHEMA UNIQUE_CONSTRAINT_NAME MATCH_OPTION UPDATE_RULE DELETE_RULE\r\n------------------ ----------------- --------------------------- ------------------------- ------------------------ ---------------------- ------------ ----------- -----------\r\nmydb               dbo               FK_SideTable_BaseTable_id   mydb                      dbo                      PK_BaseTable           SIMPLE       NO ACTION   NO ACTION\r\nmydb               dbo               FK_SideTable_BaseTable_name mydb                      dbo                      UIX_BaseTable_name     SIMPLE       NO ACTION   NO ACTION\r\n```\r\n\r\n> SELECT * FROM INFORMATION_SCHEMA.KEY_COLUMN_USAGE WHERE TABLE_NAME='SideTable'\r\n\r\n```\r\nCONSTRAINT_CATALOG CONSTRAINT_SCHEMA CONSTRAINT_NAME             TABLE_CATALOG TABLE_SCHEMA TABLE_NAME COLUMN_NAME ORDINAL_POSITION\r\n------------------ ----------------- --------------------------- ------------- ------------ ---------- ----------- ----------------\r\nmydb               dbo               FK_SideTable_BaseTable_id   mydb          dbo          SideTable  mother_id   1\r\nmydb               dbo               FK_SideTable_BaseTable_name mydb          dbo          SideTable  mother_name 1\r\nmydb               dbo               PK_SideTable                mydb          dbo          SideTable  id          1\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe problem appears to be in the join conditions of the query we generate. If I change\r\n\r\n```\r\nAND [R].[CONSTRAINT_NAME] = [INFORMATION_SCHEMA].[REFERENTIAL_CONSTRAINTS].[UNIQUE_CONSTRAINT_NAME] \r\nAND [R].[CONSTRAINT_SCHEMA] = [INFORMATION_SCHEMA].[REFERENTIAL_CONSTRAINTS].[UNIQUE_CONSTRAINT_SCHEMA] \r\n```\r\n\r\nto\r\n\r\n```\r\nAND [R].[CONSTRAINT_NAME] = [INFORMATION_SCHEMA].[REFERENTIAL_CONSTRAINTS].[CONSTRAINT_NAME] \r\nAND [R].[CONSTRAINT_SCHEMA] = [INFORMATION_SCHEMA].[REFERENTIAL_CONSTRAINTS].[CONSTRAINT_SCHEMA] \r\n```\r\n\r\nthen it returns both constraints.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/comments/938649486/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"gordthompson","id":15894006,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1ODk0MDA2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15894006?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gordthompson","html_url":"https://github.com/gordthompson","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gordthompson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gordthompson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gordthompson/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/us